{#
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  ONE PHOTO SLOT — a real image, or the default graphic (DEFAULT-GRAPHICS, 5 Oct 2026)
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Every page asks "what goes here when there is no photo?", and this partial is the one
  answer. Since the 5 Oct handoff the answer is the default graphics, and this partial
  only routes to them, so its callers did not each have to learn a new partial:

    · a real image ............ shown, `object-fit: cover`, filling the slot the caller sized
    · PEOPLE without one ...... partials/avatar.twig — initials and a tone hashed from the
                                profile id (Support\AvatarMark). Never an invented face.
    · THINGS without one ...... partials/cover.twig — the thing's KIND decides its tone and
                                pattern (Support\CoverKind), never an organiser's colour;
                                it shows the date, the title or the host's logo, whichever
                                the layout beside it does not (§5).

  Never a stock photo, never a grey box, never a broken `<img>`.

  Args (with … only):
    kind      'person' | 'thing'                       required
    src       image URL, or empty                     the caller validates it
    name      the person's name, or the thing's title  required
    alt       text alternative for a real image        default '' (decorative)
    eager     true for the largest above-the-fold paint (no lazy loading)
    class     extra classes on the slot
   things:
    subject   event | award | campaign | blog | challenge | product      default award
    cover_kind / award_linked   an event's kind (CoverKind::eventKind)
    content   auto | none | date | title — default `none`, or `title` where the caller
              still says `title: true` (the slot stands alone)
    date      the thing's real date, for content=date|auto
    logo      the host's logo, for content=none
    label     the cover's type pill: false for none, a string to name it (cover.twig)
    tone      another cover tone, for an event live now (cover.twig)
   people:
    id        the profile id the avatar tone hashes
    size      24 · 32 · 44 · 56 · 96 · 160 — the size the avatar's letters are set for
    avatar_kind  person | organisation | business | government
    verified  true for a verified record
#}
{%- set _person = (kind|default('thing')) == 'person' -%}
{%- set _src = src|default('') -%}
{%- if _src -%}
<span class="ag-photo{{ _person ? ' ag-photo--person' }}{{ class is defined ? ' ' ~ class }}">
  <img class="ag-photo__img" src="{{ _src }}" alt="{{ alt|default('') }}"{% if eager|default(false) %} fetchpriority="high"{% else %} loading="lazy"{% endif %} decoding="async">
</span>
{%- elseif _person -%}
<span class="ag-photo ag-photo--person ag-photo--mono{{ class is defined ? ' ' ~ class }}"{% if alt|default('') %} role="img" aria-label="{{ alt }}"{% else %} aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>
  {%- include 'partials/avatar.twig' with {name: name|default(''), id: id|default(null), kind: avatar_kind|default('person'),
       size: size|default(44), verified: verified|default(false), named: true, fill: true} only -%}
</span>
{%- else -%}
<span class="ag-photo ag-photo--cover{{ class is defined ? ' ' ~ class }}"{% if alt|default('') %} role="img" aria-label="{{ alt }}"{% else %} aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>
  {%- include 'partials/cover.twig' with {
       subject: subject|default('award'), kind: cover_kind|default(null), award_linked: award_linked|default(false),
       content: content|default((title is defined and title) ? 'title' : 'none'),
       date: date|default(''), title: name|default(''), logo: logo|default(''), fill: true,
       tone: tone|default(null)}|merge(label is defined ? {label: label} : {}) only -%}
</span>
{%- endif -%}
